category: Libs
build-depends: cygport CUnit libfftw3-devel
sdesc: "Library for nonequispaced discrete Fourier transform (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "The NFFT is a C subroutine library for computing the nonequispaced discrete
Fourier transform (NDFT) in one or more dimensions, of arbitrary input size,
and of complex data."
skip:

homepage: https://www-user.tu-chemnitz.de/~potts/nfft/
